<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef higher on fairly good late demand and  light to moderate offerings.  Select chuck and round cuts higher and rib and loin cuts firm, while Choice cuts higher. Beef trimmings lower on light demand and</p>
<p>moderate offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>263 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p>  9 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>37 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     104.01	104.77	 98.53	 98.31</p>
<p>Changes	   1.25	  1.50	  0.78	  0.97</p>
<p>Rib	  164.73	165.37	154.72	154.26</p>
<p>Chuck	 71.59	 72.23	 73.30	 70.95</p>
<p>Round	 89.85	 89.85	 88.00	 88.00</p>
<p>Loin	 162.06	164.49	140.96	143.51</p>
<p>Brisket     64.45	 64.45	 64.56	 64.56</p>
<p>Shrt Plate  67.65	 67.56	 67.88	 67.71</p>
<p>Flank	 59.10	 59.10	 58.42	 58.42</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
